title: Bile Acid Analysis Pipeline
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Grayson
    name-particle: W.
    family-names: Way
    email: waygw@vcu.edu
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5765-2064'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/WayGW/bile-acid-analysis-pipeline'
url: 'https://bile-acid-pipeline.streamlit.app/'
abstract: >-
  A comprehensive, user-friendly pipeline for analyzing
  LC-MS bile acid data with automatic data structure
  detection, assumption-aware statistical testing, and
  publication-quality visualizations. Recognizes 44 bile
  acid species and computes group totals, percentages, and
  clinical ratios. Exports regenerate figures from
  lightweight recipes so that large cohorts stay within
  memory limits while preserving the exact style and
  settings of every figure viewed in the app.
keywords:
  - bile acids
  - LC-MS
  - metabolomics
